* ============================================================
* DotTalk++ Messaging Surface Demo
* ============================================================
* Run with:
*   DO messaging_surface_demo
*
* Purpose:
*   Demonstrate the messaging/catalog work completed so far:
*   - locale selection and active message spine
*   - controlled message emission with placeholders
*   - real runtime localized pathways (unknown command, MSGMGR)
*   - command surfaces now routed through the shared message catalog
*
* Safety:
*   - read-only / diagnostic only
*   - no DBF/CDX/LMDB rebuild
*   - no HELP/manual/datadict mutation
* ============================================================

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO MESSAGING SURFACE DEMO
ECHO ============================================================

ECHO
ECHO --- 00. Catalog / provider / proof baseline ---
SET MESSAGE CATALOG CHECK
SET MESSAGE PROOF CHECK
SET LANGUAGE
SET LANGUAGE CHECK

ECHO
ECHO --- 01. Controlled message emission (default locale) ---
SET MESSAGE EMIT HELP_HINT_COMMAND ARG command USE
SET MESSAGE EMIT UNKNOWN_COMMAND ARG command DEMO_UNKNOWN
SET MESSAGE EMIT UNSUPPORTED_MESSAGE_LOCALE ARG locale zz-ZZ

ECHO
ECHO --- 02. Live locale switches through real runtime pathways ---
ECHO --- locale: es ---
SET LANGUAGE TO es
NOSUCHCOMMAND
MSGMGR STATUS
SET MESSAGE EMIT HELP_HINT_COMMAND ARG command USE

ECHO --- locale: fr ---
SET LANGUAGE TO fr
NOSUCHCOMMAND
MSGMGR STATUS
SET MESSAGE EMIT HELP_HINT_COMMAND ARG command USE

ECHO --- locale: de ---
SET LANGUAGE TO de
NOSUCHCOMMAND
MSGMGR STATUS
SET MESSAGE EMIT HELP_HINT_COMMAND ARG command USE

ECHO --- locale: it ---
SET LANGUAGE TO it
NOSUCHCOMMAND
MSGMGR STATUS
SET MESSAGE EMIT HELP_HINT_COMMAND ARG command USE

ECHO
ECHO --- 03. Return to default locale ---
SET LANGUAGE TO DEFAULT
SET LANGUAGE CHECK

ECHO
ECHO --- 04. Routed command surfaces (currently catalog-backed; many still fall back to en-US) ---
CLOSE
MSGMGR USAGE
BBOX MESSAGING
MAINT BOUNDARY
DDICT USAGE
DISPLAY
GO USAGE
GOTO USAGE
SKIP USAGE
TOP USAGE
BOTTOM USAGE
FIRST USAGE
LAST USAGE
NEXT USAGE
PRIOR USAGE
USE USAGE

ECHO
ECHO --- 05. Proof mode toggle ---
SET MESSAGE PROOF ON
SET MESSAGE PROOF CHECK
SET MESSAGE PROOF OFF
SET MESSAGE PROOF CHECK

ECHO
ECHO --- 06. Closing state ---
SET MESSAGE CATALOG CHECK
SET LANGUAGE
